  <data name="Starshot_ColorManagementDesc" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Reads the monitor's ICC profile to parse the real color gamut and writes the cICP/ICC chunk into the file. HDR is always BT2020; for SDR, on = real gamut from ICC, off = BT709. Enabling first probes the monitor; if the color config is invalid (e.g. VM, missing ICC), it cannot be turned on.</value>
